# Verdicts:
# - z.string().datetime() ≡ z.iso.datetime() accept sets (Z + millis accepted;
#   offset / no-tz / garbage rejected; {offset:true} accepts +07:00) → the
#   string().datetime → z.iso.datetime sweep is behavior-neutral.
# - ZodError.errors = undefined in v4 (issuesLen 1 on .issues) → .errors reads
#   must become .issues (throwValidation + global errorHandler re-applied).
# - partial().parse({}) = { n: 7 } → v4 applies create-time defaults inside
#   .partial() → partialUpdateSchema default-strip builder is mandatory.
# - coerce.number(null) → 0 (same as v3) → coerce behavior unchanged.
